---
description: Database migrations and row-level security
globs: packages/db/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- New migration = next number. Never edit an applied one.
- Money columns: numeric(18,2)
- Every tenant table: ENABLE + FORCE row level security
- Separate read and write policies. Participants (client/PMC) read only.
- Child tables use the shared access helper function, don't copy policy logic
- Set org with `set_config('app.current_org_id', :org, true)`, never `SET LOCAL x = :param`
- To change a function's parameters: DROP then CREATE, not CREATE OR REPLACE
- Add a test in apps/api/tests that proves cross-tenant access is blocked for any new table
- Only one agent runs migrations at a time
